{"parse": {"title": "4TH-15", "pageid": 6112, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/4TH-14\" title=\"4TH-14\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">4TH-15</span><a href=\"/wiki/4TH-16\" title=\"4TH-16\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">4TH</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">15</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E8.87.AA.E7.81.B0.E7.83.AC.E4.B8.AD\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"自灰烬中\">自灰烬中</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 自灰烬中</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">From the Ashes</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>被<span class=\"color-value\"></span>焚<span class=\"color-value\"></span>毁<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>被<span class=\"color-value\"></span>撕<span class=\"color-value\"></span>碎<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>被<span class=\"color-value\"></span>藏<span class=\"color-value\"></span>匿<span class=\"color-value\"></span>于<span class=\"color-value\"></span>角<span class=\"color-value\"></span>落<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>又<span class=\"color-value\"></span>被<span class=\"color-value\"></span>鸟<span class=\"color-value\"></span>儿<span class=\"color-value\"></span>衔<span class=\"color-value\"></span>起<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 10415</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-jijinhuidatang.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"jijinhuidatang\"><img alt=\"jijinhuidatang\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/Cg-jijinhuidatang.png/600px-Cg-jijinhuidatang.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/Cg-jijinhuidatang.png/900px-Cg-jijinhuidatang.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/Cg-jijinhuidatang.png/1200px-Cg-jijinhuidatang.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"505401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-505401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-505401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"505401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-505401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-505401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-505401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-505401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">拥趸Ⅰ：</div><div>祝福这胜利在望的好日子！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"509601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9d/HeadIconSmall-509601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-509601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"509601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9d/HeadIconSmall-509601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-509601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9d/HeadIconSmall-509601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-509601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">拥趸Ⅱ：</div><div>正式表决日马上就要到了。我们大获全胜……干杯！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"508501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d5/HeadIconSmall-508501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-508501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"508501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d5/HeadIconSmall-508501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-508501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d5/HeadIconSmall-508501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-508501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伯纳德：</div><div>干杯！愿和平与我们同在！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一群人正沉浸在集体的荣誉中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">Z：</div><div>兴致不错。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"505401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-505401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-505401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"505401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-505401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-505401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-505401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-505401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">拥趸Ⅰ：</div><div>……！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伯纳德：</div><div>Z女士？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"509601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9d/HeadIconSmall-509601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-509601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"509601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9d/HeadIconSmall-509601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-509601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9d/HeadIconSmall-509601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-509601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">拥趸Ⅱ：</div><div>不会是走错房间了吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"509601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9d/HeadIconSmall-509601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-509601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"509601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9d/HeadIconSmall-509601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-509601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9d/HeadIconSmall-509601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-509601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">拥趸Ⅱ：</div><div>我们这里可没有那群会胡言乱语的朋友。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>伯纳德挥了挥手，推开人群，走上前来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伯纳德：</div><div>什么事？居然能让委员大驾光临。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">Z：</div><div>借一步说话，伯纳德。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-jijinhuibangongshi.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"jijinhuibangongshi\"><img alt=\"jijinhuibangongshi\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/Cg-jijinhuibangongshi.png/600px-Cg-jijinhuibangongshi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/Cg-jijinhuibangongshi.png/900px-Cg-jijinhuibangongshi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/Cg-jijinhuibangongshi.png/1200px-Cg-jijinhuibangongshi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伯纳德：</div><div>让我看看时间，嗯，现在是下午三点，我想我还没有喝醉。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伯纳德：</div><div>你能再重复一遍刚说的话吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伯纳德：</div><div>要我为你拉票？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">Z：</div><div>准确的说，是建立合作关系。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伯纳德：</div><div>喔，喔。一个非常有创造力的想法。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伯纳德：</div><div>你打算提供什么条件？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伯纳德：</div><div>下次不再支持这样一项愚蠢的法案？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伯纳德：</div><div>还是要帮我们党团招募神秘学家新人？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">Z：</div><div>——或者是为《芝加哥办事处审查案》提供证人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伯纳德：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>在这一瞬间，他的眉头皱了起来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伯纳德：</div><div>哪个证人？告诉我名字。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">Z：</div><div>除非你愿意合作。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">Z：</div><div>或者是换一个更友好的态度跟我说话。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伯纳德：</div><div>——很抱歉。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伯纳德：</div><div>我们一直在为不同的理念服务，难免出现态度上的先入为主。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伯纳德：</div><div>但是打哑谜会阻碍我们看到彼此的诚意。不是吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">Z：</div><div>我有一位下属愿意出席作证。她的报告里记录了能证明你观点的内容。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伯纳德：</div><div>足够证明那群人失责吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">Z：</div><div>不一定，要看检察官的想法。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">Z：</div><div>但足够证明你没有因个人利益诬告陷害他人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伯纳德：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他哑然失笑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伯纳德：</div><div>看来你也有自己的小小鸟儿。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伯纳德：</div><div>那里的管理烂透了。他们不是为了人类，也不是为了神秘学家，他们只是金钱的傀儡。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伯纳德：</div><div>我想要重整那里的秩序。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伯纳德：</div><div>为此我收集到了不少证据。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伯纳德：</div><div>但可笑的是，在我向最高裁判所提起审查的第二周——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伯纳德：</div><div>它们就不见了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伯纳德：</div><div>我的下属在垃圾房里找到它们焦黑的碎片……有人将它们丢进了高温碎纸机。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伯纳德：</div><div>仿佛我除了投降，别无选择。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">Z：</div><div>骑虎难下……我能理解。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>伯纳德深吸了一口气。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伯纳德：</div><div>但你的要价太高了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伯纳德：</div><div>十一个人？我们是相反的阵营，我不可能说服所有人去为你投票。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伯纳德：</div><div>更何况庭审时间晚于正式表决时间……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伯纳德：</div><div>你不会打算先收货再付钱吧？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">Z：</div><div>不会，你可以等我们作证以后再去投票。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伯纳德：</div><div>你打算怎么做？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">Z：</div><div>用我的身份做一些力所能及的事情。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">Z：</div><div>投票表决不会这么快开始。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>伯纳德挑了挑眉毛。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伯纳德：</div><div>九张票……或者十张。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伯纳德：</div><div>作为我对你政治手腕的欣赏。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>Z女士回握住他的手。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">Z：</div><div>期待你将芝加哥办事处变得更好，伯纳德。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "4TH-15"}}